OL,3,AJailed HK activist Joshua Wong pleads
OL,4,Aguilty to foreign collusion
OL,5,
OL,6,FProminent Hong Kong pro-democracy
OL,7,Fcampaigner Joshua Wong has pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to collusion with foreign
OL,9,Fentities, a charge that carries a
OL,10,Fmaximum sentence of life in prison
OL,11,Funder Beijing's sweeping National
OL,12,FSecurity Law (NSL).
OL,14,FThe 29-year-old, who has become the
OL,15,Fposter child for political activism in
OL,16,FHong Kong, is already serving a
OL,17,Fsentence of four years and eight months
OL,18,Fafter being convicted of subversion `
OL,19,Fanother NSL violation ` in late 2024.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
